OL,3,ASanders calls on US to work with China
OL,4,Aon AI regulation as top tech bosses to
OL,5,Aspeak in California
OL,6,
OL,7,FBernie Sanders calls on the US to work
OL,8,Fwith China on AI regulation, saying a
OL,9,Ftreaty should be established pause
OL,10,Fdevelopment on "superintelligence"
OL,12,FThe independent senator remarks were
OL,13,Fmade at an AI summit in Washington,
OL,14,Fwhere Steve Bannon, a former Trump
OL,15,FWhite House adviser, is also speaking -
OL,16,Fwatch live above
OL,18,FIt all comes one day after an Anthropic
OL,19,Fexecutive told the BBC that AI is
OL,20,Fgetting more powerful "by the day" and
OL,21,Fa kill switch should be mandatory
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
