OL,3,ASanders calls on US to work with China
OL,4,Aon AI regulation as top tech bosses to
OL,5,Aspeak in California
OL,6,
OL,7,FElsewhere, top AI bosses - including
OL,8,FOpenAI's Sam Altman and Anthropic's
OL,9,FDario Amodei - will speak publicly for
OL,10,Fthe first time since the slowdown
OL,11,Fdebate emerged this week
OL,13,FEarlier this week, Donald Trump
OL,14,Fdownplayed AI concerns, saying claims
OL,15,Fthat it will take over the world are a
OL,16,F"hoax"
OL,18,FThe president has also criticised the
OL,19,Fhead of Anthropic, who is calling for a
OL,20,Fslowdown in AI development
